    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Woodbrook Point by Castlethorn, one of South Dublin's most exciting developments of quality homes on the DART line\n\nMost apartments in Woodbrook Point have 2 bedrooms and come in a variety of layouts. They are an excellent size and vary from 76 sq.m to 86 sq. m / 818 926 sq.ft. These are laid out across ground to seventh floors and some of the higher-level units will have attractive views towards the mountains to the west, or towards the golf course and to the east.\n\nUpon registering your details will be passed to Castlethorn and Sherry FitzGerald\n\nAll homes have a large kitchen / dining / living area, two bathrooms, great internal storage, excellent ceiling heights and a goof sized balcony or patio terrace. Lift access connects all floors, and the courtyard garden is accessed from floor 1. Most of the 2-bedroom apartments have an allocated parking space at ground floor level. \n\nIn addition to the apartments, a small number of 2 bedroom duplex homes are also available and the first floor of these, which contains the living areas, opens directly out onto the courtyard garden. \n\nRegister your interest now on www.woodbrookpoint.ie and we will keep you up to date with launch details, pricing and updates. Alternatively, please call Sherry FitzGerald New Homes on 01-6671888 for more information."
      },
